<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Drug distributors started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Drug distributors started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said Friday analyst Barbara Ryan started coverage of drug distributors AmeriSource Health Corp and McKesson Corp with ratings of strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Ryan also started coverage of distributors Bergen Brunswig Corp, Allegiance Corp and Cardinal Health Inc with ratings of buy.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
